    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνετέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίημι</span>)
